con-a-u14-support-beam-wood = wooden support beam
con-a-u14-support-beam-wood-desc = A wooden support beam. Place it below an upper-level floor to hold it up - cheap, but only spans a short distance.
con-a-u14-support-beam-metal = metal support beam
con-a-u14-support-beam-metal-desc = A steel support beam. Place it below an upper-level floor to hold it up - a solid, all-round span.
con-a-u14-support-beam-plasteel = plasteel support beam
con-a-u14-support-beam-plasteel-desc = A plasteel support beam. Place it below an upper-level floor to hold it up - expensive, but spans the widest platform.
con-a-u14-barricade-metal-recipe = metal barricade
con-a-u14-barricade-metal-recipe-desc = A military-grade metal barricade.
con-a-u14-barricade-metal-door-recipe = folding metal barricade
con-a-u14-barricade-metal-door-recipe-desc = A barricade that can be folded or opened to allow marines through.
con-a-u14-barricade-plasteel-recipe = plasteel barricade
con-a-u14-barricade-plasteel-recipe-desc = A military-grade hardened plasteel barricade.
con-a-u14-barricade-plasteel-door-recipe = folding plasteel barricade
con-a-u14-barricade-plasteel-door-recipe-desc = A barricade that can be folded or opened to allow marines through. Made from hardened plasteel.
con-a-u14-barricade-wood-recipe = wooden barricade
con-a-u14-barricade-wood-recipe-desc = A makeshift wooden barricade.
con-a-u14-build-wall-metal-recipe = metal wall
con-a-u14-build-wall-metal-recipe-desc = A metal wall to separate rooms. Cheap, made from metal.
con-a-u14-build-wall-wood-recipe = wood wall
con-a-u14-build-wall-wood-recipe-desc = A wooden wall. The cheapest and weakest wall.
con-a-u14-build-wall-reinforced-recipe = reinforced wall
con-a-u14-build-wall-reinforced-recipe-desc = A reinforced wall built from plasteel and metal. Strong.
con-a-u14-build-wall-heavy-recipe = heavy reinforced wall
con-a-u14-build-wall-heavy-recipe-desc = An ultra-reinforced wall. The toughest wall, built from a lot of plasteel and metal.
con-a-u14-build-table-recipe-desc = A metal table to put things on.
con-a-u14-build-table-wood-recipe = wooden table
con-a-u14-build-table-wood-recipe-desc = A wooden table to put things on.
con-a-u14-build-table-reinforced-recipe = reinforced table
con-a-u14-build-table-reinforced-recipe-desc = A reinforced desk built from plasteel and metal.
con-a-u14-build-rack-recipe-desc = A metal storage rack.
con-a-u14-build-barrel-red-recipe = red barrel
con-a-u14-build-barrel-red-recipe-desc = A red storage barrel.
con-a-u14-build-barrel-blue-recipe = blue barrel
