con-a-u14-build-barrel-white-recipe = white barrel
con-a-u14-build-barrel-white-recipe-desc = A white storage barrel.
con-a-u14-build-potted-plant-recipe = potted plant
con-a-u14-build-potted-plant-recipe-desc = A leafy potted plant. Decoration.
con-a-u14-build-closet-recipe = emergency closet
con-a-u14-build-closet-recipe-desc = A metal storage closet.
con-a-u14-h-e-s-c-o-barrier-desc = A modular, sand-filled defensive barrier used to protect against explosives and small arms fire.
con-a-u14-wood-wall-desc = A wall built from wooden planks. Effective but flammable.
