ent-c-m-u-yautja-wrench = alien wrench
ent-c-m-u-yautja-wrench-desc = A wrench with many common uses, made from bizarre alien bone and alloy.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-wirecutters = alien wirecutters
ent-c-m-u-yautja-wirecutters-desc = Alien wirecutters shaped with razor-sharp teeth.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-screwdriver = alien screwdriver
ent-c-m-u-yautja-screwdriver-desc = A high-precision alien screwdriver with a wicked point.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-multitool = alien multitool
ent-c-m-u-yautja-multitool-desc = Top-notch alien tech for opening and reconfiguring machines.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-welder = alien chem welding tool
ent-c-m-u-yautja-welder-desc = A complex chemical welding device. Keep it away from youngbloods.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-toolbelt = alien toolbelt
ent-c-m-u-yautja-toolbelt-desc = A modular alien utility belt with clips for field tools.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-metal-chains = metal chains
ent-c-m-u-yautja-metal-chains-desc = Heavy alien chains with sharpened links and a brutal weld pattern.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-hound-observation-pad = Hellhound Observation Pad
ent-c-m-u-yautja-hound-observation-pad-desc = A portable alien camera console used for remotely overwatching hellhounds.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-hivebreaker-desc = A bad blood device used to break a xenomorph's hivemind link and enthrall the serpent.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bracer = hunting bracer
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bracer-desc = A heavy wrist computer packed with alien hunting tools.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bad-blood-bracer = scavenged hunting bracer
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bad-blood-bracer-desc = A worn hunting bracer, crudely maintained. Its weapon bay has been damaged. A communicator has been wired directly into the bracer.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-thrall-bracer = thrall bracer
ent-c-m-u-yautja-thrall-bracer-desc = A simplified alien bracer that binds a thrall to a Yautja hunter.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-blooded-thrall-bracer = blooded thrall bracer
ent-c-m-u-yautja-blooded-thrall-bracer-desc = A full hunting bracer entrusted to a blooded thrall.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-thrall-gear-box = alien bracer box
ent-c-m-u-yautja-thrall-gear-box-desc = A small case containing a thrall bracer and emergency Yautja medical supplies.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-mask-desc = An alien hunting mask with a built-in tactical visor.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bracer-id-chip = embedded bracer ID chip
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bracer-id-chip-desc = A compact identification wafer deployed from a Yautja bracer.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-health-shard = health shard
ent-c-m-u-yautja-health-shard-desc = A crystalline shard pulsing with restorative energy. Split it with both hands free to activate, then plunge both halves into yourself for a burst of healing and a sustained chemical treatment.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-health-shard-half = health shard half
ent-c-m-u-yautja-health-shard-half-desc = One half of a split health shard. Use on yourself to plunge it in for immediate healing and a chemical boost.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-stabilising-crystal = stabilising crystal
ent-c-m-u-yautja-stabilising-crystal-desc = A bracer-grown crystal that rapidly stabilises alien biology.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-human-stabilising-crystal = human stabilising crystal
ent-c-m-u-yautja-human-stabilising-crystal-desc = A bracer-grown crystal tuned for humans and thralls.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-healing-capsule = healing capsule
ent-c-m-u-yautja-healing-capsule-desc = A disposable bracer-fabricated capsule of emergency predator medicine.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-mask-ornament = mask ornament
ent-c-m-u-yautja-mask-ornament-desc = A small ceremonial ornament that clips into a Yautja bio-mask.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-cloak-pack = cloaking field harness
ent-c-m-u-yautja-cloak-pack-desc = A compact field harness tuned for Yautja optical camouflage.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bad-blood-cloak-pack = ceremonial cloaking harness
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bad-blood-cloak-pack-desc = A ceremonial cape fitted with a compact cloaking field generator.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-smart-disc = smart disc
ent-c-m-u-yautja-smart-disc-desc = A razor-edged Yautja throwing disc keyed to its owner.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-plasma-caster = shoulder plasma caster
ent-c-m-u-yautja-plasma-caster-desc = A compact alien plasma weapon that draws power from a hunting bracer.
ent-c-m-u-yautja-bad-blood-plasma-caster = damaged plasma caster
