ent-c-m14-air-burst-tear-gas-desc = M74 - Airburst Grenade Munition - Personnel Denial Canister. This grenade must be launched with a grenade launcher, and detonates once it reaches its destination. It dispenses a cloud of irritant gas with temporary neuromuscular effects.
