ent-a-u14-weapon-rifle-l90-b-desc = a variant of the old standard-issue rifle of the royal marine with a heavily modified firing mechanism, giving it a burst-fire option. Comes with built-in underbarell shotgun.
ent-a-u14-weapon-rifle-l90-b-full = Magazine
ent-a-u14-attachment-l90-m-scope = 4x telescopic scope
ent-a-u14-attachment-l90-m-scope-desc = L90 Marksman 4x telescopic eye piece. Fixed at 4x zoom.
ent-r-m-c-attachment-l90-b-underbarrel-shotgun = underbarrel shotgun
ent-r-m-c-attachment-l90-b-underbarrel-shotgun-desc = Tactical shotgun. Attaches to the underbarrel of most weapons. Only capable of loading up to five buckshot shells. Specialized for breaching into buildings.
ent-a-u14-weapon-rifle-l90-m-desc = The L90M Marksman rifle, a variant of the old standard-issue rifle of the royal marine. This particular version of the weapon has been given a custom stock, a variable zoom scope and a longer barrel. Reliable and deadly.
