ent-a-u14-weapon-s-m-g-l90-a2-desc = The L90A2 personal defense weapon, found commonly in Three World Empire's armories. This version has shortened barrel and modified fire mechanism, allowing full-auto and burst fire. Chambered in 10x20mm Parabellum.
