ent-a-u14-grenade-neuro-r-m-c = R2175/CN20 grenade
ent-a-u14-grenade-neuro-r-m-c-desc = A small grenade containing a vial of deadly nerve gas. Usually knocks out the targets for long enough to allow RMCs to take them out. You can almost hear your Instructor's screaming in the back of your head, mentioning something about a gas mask. It is set to detonate in 3.5 seconds.
ent-a-u14-packet-grenade-high-explosive-r-m-c = R2175/A HEDP grenade packet
ent-a-u14-packet-grenade-high-explosive-r-m-c-desc = It contains three R2175/A HEDP grenades. Handle with care.
ent-a-u14-box-h-e-d-p-r-m-c = R2175/A HEDP grenade box
ent-a-u14-box-h-e-d-p-r-m-c-desc = A secure box holding 18 30mm R2175/A High-Explosive Dual-Purpose grenades. High explosive, don't store near the flamer fuel.
ent-a-u14-packet-grenade-neuro-r-m-c = R2175/CN20 gas grenade packet
