ent-a-u14-box-gas-r-m-c = R2175/CN20 gas grenade box
ent-a-u14-box-gas-r-m-c-desc = A secure box holding 18 R2175/CN20 nerve-gas grenades. Highly lethal, ensure caps are fitted securely before storage.
ent-a-u14-packet-grenade-incendiary-r-m-c = R2175/B HIDP grenade packet
ent-a-u14-packet-grenade-incendiary-r-m-c-desc = It contains three 2175/B HIDP incendiary grenades.
ent-a-u14-box-h-i-d-p-r-m-c = R2175/B HIDP grenade box
ent-a-u14-box-h-i-d-p-r-m-c-desc = A secure box holding 18 R2175/B HIDP grenades. Highly flammable, don't store near open flames.
ent-a-u14-packet20-m-m-grenade-frag-r-m-c = L104A1 20mm fragmentation grenade packet
ent-a-u14-packet20-m-m-grenade-frag-r-m-c-desc = It contains eight L104A1 20mm frag grenades. Handle with care.
