ent-c-m-u-weapon-shotgun-olympiets-desc = A limited production copy of the MOU53, this one can safely fire buckshot shells.
ent-a-u14-weapon-rifle-a-g80-desc = Pulse action 9.7x16mm caseless assault rifle of the UPPAC Naval Infantry. Only recently entered service and has yet to see full integration.
