ent-a-u14-cartridge-rifle97x16mm-a-p-desc = A 9.7x16mm armor-piercing cartridge for the AG80 rifle.
ent-a-u14-attachment-a-g80-stock-collapsible = AG80 folding stock
ent-a-u14-attachment-a-g80-stock-collapsible-desc = The standard back end of any gun starting with AG80. Compatible with the AG80 series, this stock reduces recoil and scatter, but at a reduction to handling and agility. Also enhances the thwacking of things with the stock-end of the rifle.
ent-a-u14-attachment-g-p45-grenade-launcher = GP-45 grenade launcher
ent-a-u14-attachment-g-p45-grenade-launcher-desc = A weapon-mounted, reloadable grenade launcher.
ent-a-u14-smart-gun-u-p-p-desc = Copy of the M56 Smartgun, the RVS-37 "Canyon", produced by major countries inside of UPP.
ent-a-u14-magazine-smart-gun-u-p-p = RVS-37 drum magazine (12.7x40mm)
ent-a-u14-cartridge-smart-gun127x40mm = cartridge (12.7x40mm)
ent-a-u14-bullet-smart-gun127x40mm = bullet (12.7x40mm)
ent-a-u14-power-cell-smartgun-u-p-p = GB-12-U3 battery
ent-a-u14-power-cell-smartgun-u-p-p-desc = UPP standard-issue 12-volt lead-acid battery, used by the UPPAC to power just about anything short of armored vehicles. This one seems to be a variant made to power automated machineguns. Also could be used as a blunt weapon.
ent-a-u14-grenade-high-explosive-u-p-p = Type 6 fragmentation grenade
ent-a-u14-grenade-smoke-u-p-p = RDG-17 smoke grenade
ent-a-u14-grenade-incendiary-u-p-p = Type 8 incendiary grenade
