ent-a-u14-head-beret-i-o = intelligence officer beret
ent-a-u14-head-beret-i-o-desc = A distinctive crimson beret worn by intelligence officers. Reinforced with flexible Kevlar, it offers minimal protection while maintaining a traditional and respected appearance.
ent-a-u14-head-beret-s-o = staff officer beret
