ent-a-u14-head-commando-beanie = Beanie
ent-a-u14-head-commando-beanie-desc = A beanie to hide your bald head. Looks strangely similar to the beanie used by the LACN Naval Commandos.
ent-a-u14-armband-yellow = yellow armband
ent-a-u14-armband-yellow-desc = Fancy yellow armband.
ent-c-m-u14-u-s-c-m-m-p-brassard = MP Brassard
ent-c-m-u14-u-s-c-m-m-p-brassard-desc = A Military Police brassard bearing the emblem of the United States Colonial Marines and bold white letters displaying "MP".
ent-a-u14-universal-black-fatigues = Black Fatigues
ent-a-u14-universal-black-fatigues-desc = A set of black fatigues. It has shards of light Kevlar to help protect against shrapnel.
ent-a-u14-webbing-magazine = magazine webbing
