ent-a-u14-webbing-utility = utility webbing
ent-a-u14-webbing-utility-desc = A synthcotton webbing vest with lots of pockets to hold whatever you need, but cannot hold in hands.
ent-a-u14-webbing-drop-pouch = drop pouch
ent-a-u14-webbing-drop-pouch-desc = A convenient pouch to carry loose items around.
ent-a-u14-webbing-admin-pouch = admin pouch
ent-a-u14-webbing-admin-pouch-desc = A pouch to carry your administrative equipment around.
ent-a-u14-webbing-knives = knife webbing
ent-a-u14-webbing-knives-desc = An older generation knife vest. Can hold up to 5 knives. It is made of synthcotton.
ent-c-m-u14-drop-surgical-green = green surgical drop pouch
ent-c-m-u14-drop-surgical-green-desc = A greenish synthcotton drop pouch purpose-made for holding surgical tools.
ent-c-m-u14-drop-surgical-blue = blue surgical drop pouch
ent-c-m-u14-drop-surgical-blue-desc = A matte blue synthcotton drop pouch purpose-made for holding surgical tools.
ent-c-m-u14-drop-surgical-black = black surgical drop pouch
ent-c-m-u14-drop-surgical-black-desc = A tactical black synthcotton drop pouch purpose-made for holding surgical tools.
ent-a-u14-backpack-marine-black = lightweight IMP backpack
ent-a-u14-backpack-marine-black-desc = A standard-issue pack. Designed to lug gear into the battlefield.
ent-a-u14-satchel-marine-intel-black = lightweight expedition pack
ent-a-u14-satchel-marine-intel-black-desc = A heavy-duty IMP based backpack that can be slung around the front or to the side, and can quickly be accessed with only one hand.
ent-a-u14-backpack-rockets = universal rocket bag
ent-a-u14-backpack-rockets-desc = A specially-designed backpack that fits universally to any common mounting frame. It's made of two easily-accessible, waterproofed reinforced tubes and one smaller satchel slung at the bottom. The two silos are for rockets, but no one is stopping you from cramming other things in there.
ent-a-u14-spike-boots = M-19 "Treadnailer" assault boots
ent-a-u14-spike-boots-desc = >-
ent-a-u14-pouch-i-f-a-k = infantry first aid kit pouch
ent-a-u14-pouch-i-f-a-k-desc = It can carry small medical supplies.
ent-a-u14-pouch-police-equipment-support-synth = police equipment pouch
ent-a-u14-pouch-police-equipment-support-synth-desc = A general-purpose pouch used to carry police equipment.
ent-a-u14-pouch-gas-mask-bag = gas mask bag
ent-a-u14-pouch-gas-mask-bag-desc = A small bag designed to carry a gas mask and a few spare filters. Can be worn in a pocket, attached to a uniform as webbing, or stashed in a backpack.
ent-a-u14-boots-jungle = jungle boots
ent-a-u14-boots-jungle-desc = Standard issue USCM jungle boots.
ent-a-u14-boots-u-s-army = army combat boots
ent-a-u14-boots-u-s-army-desc = Standard issue combat boots for combat scenarios or combat situations. All combat, all the time.
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-clear-ballistic = clear M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-clear-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes.
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-ballistic = M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes.
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-dark-ballistic = dark M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-dark-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes.
ent-a-u14-goggles-m60 = M60 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-m60-desc = Older issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes.
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-laser-ballistic = laser shielded M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-laser-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes. Also protects your eyes from lasers!
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-polarized-ballistic = ventrax polarized goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-polarized-ballistic-desc = On the market as civilian goggles, the brand’s pretty ambiguous, but they seem to be made by Ventrax, a subsidiary of some other Wey-Yu subsidiary. Figures. They were probably meant for skiing, you don’t really remember or care. Surprisingly, they make decent combat goggles... at least better than the M1A1s or God forbid, those M60s. The LT says the colored lens will get you killed by a sniper... but at least you’ll die looking cool.
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-orange-ballistic = ventrax orange goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-m1-a1-orange-ballistic-desc = On the market as civilian goggles, the brand’s pretty ambiguous, but they seem to be made by Ventrax, a subsidiary of some other Wey-Yu subsidiary. Figures. They were probably meant for skiing, you don’t really remember or care. Surprisingly, they make decent combat goggles... at least better than the M1A1s or God forbid, those M60s. You swear the orange tint makes you see better at night.
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-clear-ballistic = prescription clear M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-clear-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes. Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-ballistic = prescription M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes. Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-dark-ballistic = prescription dark M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-dark-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes. Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-laser-ballistic = prescription laser shielded M1A1 ballistic goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-laser-ballistic-desc = Newer issue USCM goggles. They are capable of preventing insects, dust, and other things from getting into one's eyes. Also protects your eyes from lasers! Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-polarized-ballistic = prescription ventrax polarized goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-polarized-ballistic-desc = On the market as civilian goggles, the brand’s pretty ambiguous, but they seem to be made by Ventrax, a subsidiary of some other Wey-Yu subsidiary. Surprisingly, they make decent combat goggles. Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-orange-ballistic = prescription ventrax orange goggles
ent-a-u14-goggles-prescription-m1-a1-orange-ballistic-desc = On the market as civilian goggles, the brand’s pretty ambiguous, but they seem to be made by Ventrax, a subsidiary of some other Wey-Yu subsidiary. Surprisingly, they make decent combat goggles. You swear the orange tint makes you see better at night. Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-p-v-e-hands-insulated-black-marine = insulated combat gloves
ent-a-u14-p-v-e-hands-insulated-black-marine-desc = Standard issue tactical gloves with insulated fibers.
ent-a-u14-p-v-e-hands-fingerless-black-gloves = fingerless combat gloves
ent-a-u14-p-v-e-hands-fingerless-black-gloves-desc = Standard issue tactical gloves with the fingers cut off, no longer providing protection against electrical shocks.
