ent-a-u14-p-v-e-hands-fingerless-brown-gloves-desc = Standard issue tactical gloves with the fingers cut off, no longer providing protection against electrical shocks.
ent-a-u14-mask-u-s-a-s-f-pilot-oxygen = USASF LAH-99 Oxygen Mask
ent-a-u14-mask-u-s-a-s-f-pilot-oxygen-desc = A mask attached to USASF LAH-99 helmets to provide aircrew with breathable oxygen.
ent-a-u14-m-o-p-p-mask = CBRN M3 MOPP mask
ent-a-u14-m-o-p-p-mask-desc = The M3 MOPP mask includes a full covering cowl that securely attaches to the MOPP suit. The mask filters out harmful particles in the air to allow the wearer to breathe safely in the field. Depending on the hostility of the contaminated area the mask’s filter will last an average of 12 hours or less.
