ent-a-u14-armor-smart-gun-desert-combat-harness-desc = An M56 Combat Harness specially made for Smartgunners.
ent-a-u14-armor-smart-gun-jungle-combat-harness = M56 Jungle Harness
ent-a-u14-armor-smart-gun-jungle-combat-harness-desc = An M56 Combat Harness specially made for Smartgunners.
ent-a-u14-external-webbing = external webbing
ent-a-u14-external-webbing-desc = Designed to be worn over a jumpsuit rather than clipped on.
ent-a-u14-scout-webbing = Light scout webbing
ent-a-u14-scout-webbing-desc = Designed to be worn over a jumpsuit rather than clipped on, special cut and fitted for scout operations with increased storage and some armor.
ent-a-u14-u-s-a-s-f-i-c-p-s2 = USASF ICPS-2 Aircrew Armor
ent-a-u14-u-s-a-s-f-i-c-p-s2-desc = A set of ballistic armor used by USASF aircrew with an attached oxygen tank.
ent-foldabletestarmor = USASF ICPS-2 Aircrew Armor
ent-foldabletestarmor-desc = A set of ballistic armor used by USASF aircrew.
ent-a-u14-armor-ghillie = M45 pattern jungle ghillie armor
ent-a-u14-armor-ghillie-desc = A lightweight ghillie camouflage suit, used by UA snipers on recon missions. Very lightweight, but doesn't protect much.
ent-a-u14-armor-u-s-army = Personal Body Armor System
ent-a-u14-armor-u-s-army-desc = The Personnel Body Armor System is the standard issue armor of the US Army, adopted over the M4 series pattern armor during field trials. Surprisingly uncomfortable, but offering far superior protection to the M3 or M4 series armor. At four times the price.
ent-a-u14-armor-u-s-army-normal = Personal Body Armor System
ent-a-u14-armor-u-s-army-normal-desc = The Personnel Body Armor System is the standard issue armor of the US Army, adopted over the M4 series pattern armor during field trials. Surprisingly uncomfortable, but offering far superior protection to the M3 or M4 series armor. At four times the price.
ent-a-u14-armor-u-s-army-synth = Synthetic Body Armor System
ent-a-u14-armor-u-s-army-synth-desc = This is a variant of the Personnel Body Armor System, it has been modified extensively to be used by US Army Synthetics. It offers light protection, maximum mobility and more internal storage than its USCM counterpart. The cost of this item could outfit an entire squad of USCM Marines, but you are worth this cost.
ent-a-u14-armor-m3-r-forecon = M3-R pattern light armor
ent-a-u14-camo-armor-m3-smooth = M3 pattern smooth USCM armor
ent-a-u14-camo-armor-m3-ribbed = M3 pattern ribbed USCM armor
ent-a-u14-camo-armor-m3-dimpled = M3 pattern dimpled USCM armor
ent-a-u14-camo-armor-smart-gun-combat-harness = M56 Combat Harness
ent-a-u14-camo-armor-smart-gun-combat-harness-desc = An M56 Combat Harness specially made for Smartgunners.
ent-a-u14-armor-c-b-r-n = CBRN M3-M armor
ent-a-u14-armor-c-b-r-n-desc = While lacking the appearance of the M3 pattern armor worn in regular service, this armor piece is still a derivative of it. It has been heavily modified to fit over the MOPP suit with additional padding and Venlar composite layers removed, so as not to restrict the wearer’s movement. However, with the reduction of composite layers, the personal protection offered is less than desired with complaints having been lodged since 2165.
ent-a-u14-glasses-bi-mex = BiMex Ballistic Glasses
ent-a-u14-glasses-bi-mex-desc = A pair of black tinted shooting glasses. USCM issue.
