ent-a-u14-backpack-r-t-o-pack-black-desc = The AN/PRC-55 Portable Transceiver, also known as AN/PRC 55 Radio Set, is a man-pack, portable VHF FM combat-net radio transceiver manufactured by Armat Battlefield Systems and used to provide short-range, two-way radiotelephone voice communication.
ent-a-u14-backpack-r-t-o-pack-jungle = Jungle AN/PRC-55 Portable Transceiver
