ent-a-u14-h-a-z-o-p-shecu-beret-desc = A beret bearing the insignia of the Hazardous Operations Unit. My. Ass. Is. HEAVY!
ent-a-u14-h-a-z-o-p-shelmet = MAR-PASGT helmet
ent-a-u14-h-a-z-o-p-shelmet-desc = A much less expensive variant of the army's PASGT system helmet. More compact and lightweight, ideal for HAZOPS teams.
ent-a-u14-armor-h-a-z-o-p-s-p-w-a = powered warfighting armor
ent-a-u14-armor-h-a-z-o-p-s-p-w-a-desc = A specially designed vest for hazardous operations. Supposedly has a battery charge for "extra functionality", but nobody knows how to charge it.  Despite the armor plating providing higher biological resistance and slightly higher strike shielding, it is less protective against bullets than the standard issue USCM armor.
ent-a-u14-armor-h-a-z-o-p-s-c-b-r-n = M5-CBRN
ent-a-u14-armor-h-a-z-o-p-s-c-b-r-n-desc = Before the PWA, this was the standard issue vest of HAZOPS. You think it would pair nicely with your M17A4.
ent-a-u14-mask-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m40 = M40A4 gas mask
ent-a-u14-mask-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m40-desc = The distant cousin of the M40 gasmask from the 1990s. Designed specifically for HAZOPS teams, it provides heightened resistance to biological contaminants.
ent-a-u14-mask-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m17 = M17A4 gas mask
ent-a-u14-mask-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m17-desc = The evolution of the same mask your great great grandaddy complained about during his deployment in 'Nam. Heavy, big, and uncomfortable to wear. Donned with a CBRN hood.
ent-a-u14-mask-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m17-flamer = M17A4-FLAME gas mask
ent-a-u14-mask-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m17-flamer-desc = This ain't your grandaddy's M17. Designed for high-temperture weapon use, this mask will make sure you don't burn up while you flame the push.
ent-a-u14-mask-prescription-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m40 = prescription M40A4 gas mask
ent-a-u14-mask-prescription-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m40-desc = The distant cousin of the M40 gasmask from the 1990s. Designed specifically for HAZOPS teams, it provides heightened resistance to biological contaminants. Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-mask-prescription-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m17 = prescription M17A4 gas mask
ent-a-u14-mask-prescription-gas-h-a-z-o-p-s-m17-desc = The evolution of the same mask your great great grandaddy complained about during his deployment in 'Nam. Heavy, big, and uncomfortable to wear. Donned with a CBRN hood. Contains prescription lenses.
ent-a-u14-boots-c-b-r-n-h-a-z-o-p-s-desc = High-quality CBRN boots for HAZOPS use.
ent-a-u14-h-a-z-o-p-s-battery-minigun-g-a-u19-backpack = GAU-19/H battery pack
