ent-a-u14-head-cap-officer-r-m-c = royal marine officer peaked cap
ent-a-u14-head-cap-officer-r-m-c-desc = Gray peaked cap belonging to the Three World Empire Royal Marines Commando officer. Shown to show your men who's the boss.
ent-a-u14-armor-r-m-c = kestrel armoured vest
ent-a-u14-armor-r-m-c-desc = A customizable personal armor system used by the Royal Crown Marines.
ent-a-u14-armor-light-r-m-c = kestrel light armoured vest
