ent-a-u14-i-c-p-s2-r-m-c-desc = A set of ballistic armor used by RMC aircrew.
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c = Mk16 pattern ballistic helmet
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-desc = A High-cut ballistic helmet. Designed to be used by Royal Crown Marines as part of the kestrel armour system.
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-sniper = Mk12 pattern sniper helmet
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-sniper-desc = A High-cut ballistic helmet. Designed to be used by Royal Crown Marines snipers and marksmen as part of the kestrel armour system.
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-heavy = Mk20 pattern heavy helmet
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-heavy-desc = Heavy, ballistic helmet. Designed to be used by Royal Crown Marines smartgunners and pointmen as part of the kestrel armour system.
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-ballistic = Mk17 pattern ballistic helmet
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-ballistic-desc = A ballistic helmet featuring an attached mandible. Designed to be used by Royal Marines Commando as part of the kestrel armour system.
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-medic = Mk16 pattern corpsman helmet
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-medic-desc = A High-cut ballistic helmet. Designed to be used by Royal Marines Commando as part of the kestrel armour system. This variant worn by medic marines.
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-aircrew = Mk30 pattern aircrew helmet
ent-a-u14-head-helmet-r-m-c-aircrew-desc = A High-cut ballistic helmet. Designed to be used by Royal Marines Commando as part of the kestrel armour system. This variant worn by aircrews.
