ent-a-u14-fatigues-desert-r-m-c-teamlead-desc = Standart-issue Three World Empire Royal Marines Commando fatigues. Usually worn by sergeants or officers.
ent-a-u14-fatigues-black-r-m-c-teamlead = black royal marine team leader fatigues
ent-a-u14-fatigues-service-r-m-c = royal marine service uniform
ent-a-u14-fatigues-service-r-m-c-desc = Standart-issue Three World Empire Royal Marines Commando service uniform. Usually worn by officers.
ent-a-u14-pilot-jumpsuit-r-m-c = royal marine aircrew jumpsuit
ent-a-u14-pilot-jumpsuit-r-m-c-desc = A standard RMC Aircrew Jumpsuit. It has shards of light Kevlar to help protect against shrapnel.
ent-a-u14-webbing-drop-pouch-r-m-c = royal marine drop pouch
ent-a-u14-webbing-drop-pouch-r-m-c-desc = A convenient pouch to carry loose items around.
ent-a-u14-webbing-admin-pouch-r-m-c = royal marine admin pouch
ent-a-u14-webbing-admin-pouch-r-m-c-desc = A pouch to carry your administrative equipment around.
ent-a-u14-small-backpack-r-m-c = royal marine small backpack
ent-a-u14-small-backpack-r-m-c-desc = The standard-issue pack of TWE forces. Designed to lug gear into the battlefield.
ent-a-u14-frame-backpack-r-m-c = royal marine backpack frame
ent-a-u14-frame-backpack-r-m-c-desc = The standard-issue pack of RMC forces. Designed to lug gear into the battlefield.
ent-a-u14-backpack-r-m-c = royal marine medium backpack
ent-a-u14-backpack-r-m-c-desc = The standard-issue pack of TWE forces. Designed to lug gear into the battlefield.
ent-a-u14-corpsman-backpack-r-m-c = royal marine medical backpack
ent-a-u14-corpsman-backpack-r-m-c-desc = The standard-issue pack of TWE forces. Designed to lug gear into the battlefield. This one has a red cross on it.
ent-a-u14-large-backpack-r-m-c = royal marine large backpack
ent-a-u14-large-backpack-r-m-c-desc = A large pack. Designed to engineering equipment and explosives into the battlefield.
ent-a-u14-welder-backpack-r-m-c = royal marine welderpack
ent-a-u14-welder-backpack-r-m-c-desc = A specialized backpack worn by RMC technicians. It carries a fueltank for quick welder refueling and use.
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-shin-guards-r-m-c = kestrel shin guards
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-shin-guards-r-m-c-desc = An armor piece made to be used in combination with kestrel pattern armor.
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-shoulder-pads-r-m-c = kestrel shoulder pads
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-shoulder-pads-r-m-c-desc = An armor piece made to be used in combination with kestrel pattern armor.
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-magazine-webbing-r-m-c = 82 pattern magazine webbing
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-magazine-webbing-r-m-c-desc = A magazine webbing made to be attached to the outside of kestrel pattern armor.
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-small-webbing-r-m-c = 67 pattern small webbing
ent-a-u14-armor-garb-small-webbing-r-m-c-desc = A small webbing made to be attached to the outside of kestrel pattern armor.
ent-a-u14-a-i-core-apollo-civilian = APOLLO Central A.I.
ent-a-u14-a-i-core-apollo-civilian-desc = This is the artificial intelligence system for monitoring the Working Joes. It is manufactured by Seegson Corporation.
ent-a-u14-a-i-core-apollo-g-o-v-f-o-r = APOLLO Central A.I.
ent-a-u14-a-i-core-apollo-o-p-f-o-r = APOLLO Central A.I.
ent-a-u14-a-i-core-c-p-u = APOLLO CPU
ent-a-u14-a-i-core-c-p-u-desc = This is APOLLO's central processor. Made of a casing designed to withstand nuclear blasts, the CPU also contains APOLLO's blackbox recorder.
