ent-a-u14-l4-d2cardboardcutoutjohnnywayne-desc = A cardboard cutout of famous UA stockcar racer Johnny Wayne Jr. The real him spawns every 15 days.
ent-a-u14-hybrisa-extinguisher-cabinet = extinguisher cabinet
ent-a-u14-hybrisa-extinguisher-cabinet-desc = A small wall mounted cabinet designed to hold a fire extinguisher.
