ent-a-u14-communications-tower = TC-5F static telecommunications tower
ent-a-u14-communications-tower-desc = A static heavy-duty TC-5F telecom-frequency tower. Used to set up subspace communications lines between planetary and extra-planetary locations. Will need to have extra communication frequencies programmed into it by multitool.
ent-a-u14-spawner-communications-tower-base = static comms
