ent-c-m-u-fog-wall-lament-waterfall-mist = waterfall mist
ent-c-m-u-fog-wall-lament-waterfall-mist-desc = The mist of a waterfall, there might be something behind it!
ent-c-m-u-wall-wood-reinforced-heavy = heavy reinforced wood hull
ent-c-m-u-wall-wood-reinforced-heavy-desc = A huge chunk of ultra-reinforced wood used to separate rooms. Looks virtually indestructible.
