ent-c-m-u-shutter-hybrisa-adjutant-lock = armory shutters
ent-c-m-u-shutter-hybrisa-adjutant-lock-desc = A heavy set of shutters designed to keep the armory secure. They can be opened by a button in the CIC. If command is not awake to open these shutters, they will open themselves after a time.
ent-c-m-u-pod-door-button-adjutant-lock = armory shutters control
ent-c-m-u-pod-door-button-adjutant-lock-desc = A button that locks open on its own if command doesn't show up to operate it.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-plasma-tree = plasma node
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-plasma-tree-desc = A pulsing node that has liquid plasma dripping around it.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-plasma-tree-construction-node = plasma node
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-plasma-tree-construction-node-desc = A pulsing node that has liquid plasma dripping around it. Looks like a marker for something.
ent-c-m-u-pathogen-spore-sac = spore sac
ent-c-m-u-pathogen-spore-sac-desc = A pulsating, fleshy sac that releases a cloud of toxic spores. Don't touch it.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-weeds = mycelium weeds
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-weeds-desc = Pale fibrous mycelium threads spreading across the floor. They feel spongy underfoot.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-weeds-source = mycelium node
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-weeds-source-desc = A pulsating knot of mycelium threads. It slowly spreads spores across the floor.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-hive-weeds = dense mycelium weeds
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-hive-weeds-source = dense mycelium node
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-hive-weeds-source-desc = A large, pulsating knot of dense mycelium. It floods the surrounding area with spores.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-weeds-wall = mycelium weeds
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-pylon = mycelium pylon
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-pylon-desc = A towering spike of mycelium. Its base pulsates with large tendrils.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-pylon-construction-node = mycelium pylon
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-pylon-construction-node-desc = A towering spike of mycelium. Looks like a marker for something.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-wall = mycelium wall
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-wall-desc = A dense wall of pale, fibrous mycelium secreted by a Neomorph. It pulses faintly with bioluminescent light.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-thick-mycelium-wall = thick mycelium wall
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-thick-mycelium-wall-desc = A heavily reinforced mycelium wall. The fibrous strands have fused into a dense, almost chitinous mass.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-membrane = mycelium membrane
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-membrane-desc = A translucent sheet of mycelium, thin enough to see through but tough enough to slow a marine advance.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-thick-mycelium-membrane = thick mycelium membrane
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-thick-mycelium-membrane-desc = A reinforced mycelium membrane. It remains just translucent enough to make out shapes on the other side.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-door = mycelium door
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-door-desc = A curtain of living mycelium fibres that parts when an ally approaches. It smells faintly of spores.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-thick-mycelium-door = thick mycelium door
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-thick-mycelium-door-desc = A dense, reinforced curtain of mycelium. The fibres have hardened into something almost solid.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-nest = mycelium nest
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-mycelium-nest-desc = A cradle of pale, sticky mycelium fibres woven into a nest shape. A captured host would be held fast by its adhesive strands.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-sporecaster-desc = A disgusting biomass generator that reeks of rotting flesh. Capable of producing spore clouds on its own.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-sporecaster-construction-node-desc = A disgusting biomass generator. Looks like a marker for something.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-overmind-core = overmind core
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-overmind-core-desc = A pulsating organic mass. You feel drawn to it.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-blight-core = blight core
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-blight-core-desc = A pulsating organic mass. You feel drawn to it.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-blight-core-construction-node = blight core
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-blight-core-construction-node-desc = A pulsating organic mass. Looks like a marker for something.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-cluster = mycelium cluster
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-cluster-desc = A large clump of mycelium. It rhythmically pulses, as if its pumping something into the blight below...
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-cluster-construction-node = mycelium cluster
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-cluster-construction-node-desc = A large clump of mycelium. Looks like a marker for something.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-recovery-node = recovery node
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-recovery-node-desc = A warm, soothing mass that hastily recovers the strength of sisters resting around it.
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-recovery-node-construction-node = recovery node
ent-c-m-u14-pathogen-recovery-node-construction-node-desc = A warm, soothing mass. Looks like a marker for something.
