ent-c-m-u14-xeno-bloodburster-aberration-base = Bloodburster
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-bloodburster-aberration-base-desc = An aberration upon the honor of us all!
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-aberration-bloodburster = Bloodburster
