ent-c-m-u14-xeno-haze-base = Haze
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-haze-base-desc = A supportive strain of the Confluence, tending wounds and spreading spores in equal measure.
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-haze = Haze
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-aberration-base = Aberration
ent-c-m-u14-xeno-aberration-base-desc = If you believe in a god, now would be a good time for prayer...
