ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-bull-plow = Plow
ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-bull-plow-desc = Set your charge to plow through targets without stopping.
ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-bull-headbutt = Headbutt
ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-bull-headbutt-desc = Set your charge to slam a target aside and end the rush.
ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-bull-gore = Gore
ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-bull-gore-desc = Set your charge to gore a target for heavier damage and end the rush.
ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-z-jump = Z-Jump
ent-c-m-u-action-xeno-z-jump-desc = Leap upward and forward, crossing to the Z level above if the path is clear.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-paralyzing-slash = Paralyzing Slash
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-paralyzing-slash-desc = Prime your next strike to slow the target on hit.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-place-spore-sac = Place Spore Sac
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-place-spore-sac-desc = Plant a sac that will burst into a cloud of toxic spores.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-direct-spore-infect = Direct Infect
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-direct-spore-infect-desc = Press a handful of spores against an adjacent target, directly infecting them.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-blight-wave = Blight Wave
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-blight-wave-desc = Emit a raspy guttural roar that extinguishes lights and overwhelms nearby enemies.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-cyclone = Cyclone
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-cyclone-desc = Channel briefly then spin in a devastating circle. Hit enough targets to trigger additional expanding spin cycles.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-overmind-change-form = Change Form
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-overmind-change-form-desc = Shift between incorporeal eye and manifested physical form.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-mycotoxin-inject = Mycotoxin Injection
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-mycotoxin-inject-desc = Skewer a dead target with your tail, injecting mycotoxin. They will rise again to serve the Confluence.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-mycotoxin-inject-matriarch = Mycotoxin Injection
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-mycotoxin-inject-matriarch-desc = Skewer a critically wounded or dead target with your tail, injecting mycotoxin. They will rise again to serve the Confluence.
