ent-action-blackfoot-takeoff-desc = Begin the VTOL takeoff sequence.
ent-action-blackfoot-land = Blackfoot Landing
ent-action-blackfoot-land-desc = Begin the VTOL landing sequence.
ent-action-blackfoot-flight-mode-toggle = Toggle Blackfoot Flight Mode
ent-action-blackfoot-flight-mode-toggle-desc = Switch between VTOL hover and forward flight.
ent-action-blackfoot-rear-door-toggle = Toggle Blackfoot Rear Door
ent-action-blackfoot-rear-door-toggle-desc = Open or close the Blackfoot rear door.
ent-action-blackfoot-stow-toggle = Stow Blackfoot
ent-action-blackfoot-stow-toggle-desc = Fold or deploy the Blackfoot while grounded.
ent-action-blackfoot-ascend-z-level = Blackfoot Ascend
ent-action-blackfoot-ascend-z-level-desc = Climb the Blackfoot up one Z-level.
ent-action-blackfoot-descend-z-level = Blackfoot Descend
ent-action-blackfoot-descend-z-level-desc = Descend the Blackfoot down one Z-level.
ent-action-blackfoot-door-gun-z-mode-toggle = Toggle M866 Z-Fire
ent-action-blackfoot-door-gun-z-mode-toggle-desc = Switch the M866 between current Z-level fire and one-level-down fire.
ent-action-marine-govfor-silence = Issue Order - Silence
ent-action-marine-govfor-silence-desc = Commands the area into silence. Nearby personnel can only whisper for 15 seconds.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-rest = Rest
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-rest-desc = Lie down to regenerate health more quickly while on weeds. [color=red]Your rest keybind will also activate this action, Shift+R by default.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-watch = Watch Neomorph
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-pheromones = Emit Pheromones (35)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-pheromones-desc = Gives a buff to nearby neomorph. [color=cyan]Consumes 2.5 plasma per second.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-hide = Hide
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-hide-desc = Hide under tables and other objects.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-toggle-crest = Toggle Crest Defense
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-toggle-crest-desc = Increases your resistance to direct damage but slows you down. You count as one size bigger while your crest is lowered.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fortify = Fortify
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fortify-desc = Become immobile and impassable to mobs, dramatically increasing your resistance to direct damage and explosions. Damage is further reduced from the direction you are facing. You can't be stunned by minor explosions. You count as two sizes bigger while fortified and still can attack structures or use tail slam.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fortify-steelcrest = Fortify
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fortify-steelcrest-desc = Become much slower, increasing your resistance to direct damage and explosions. Damage is greatly reduced from the direction you are facing. You count as two sizes bigger while fortified and still can attack structures or use tail slam, but your slashes do less damage.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-resin-walker = Resin Walker (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-resin-walker-desc = Run faster on weeds. [color=cyan]Consumes 30 plasma per second.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-zoom = Toggle Long-Range Sight
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-word-queen = Word of the Overmind (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-word-queen-desc = Sends a message to all members of your hive.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-psychic-whisper = Psychic Whisper
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-psychic-whisper-desc = Whisper a psychic message to a nearby mind.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-psychic-radiance = Psychic Radiance (100)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-psychic-radiance-desc = Radiate a psychic message to nearby minds.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-give-order = Give Order (100)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-give-order-desc = Send a psychic order to the neomorph you are watching.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-grow-ovipositor = Grow Ovipositor (500)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-grow-ovipositor-desc = Become immobile and start laying eggs which will produce children. Has a 5 minute cooldown. [color=red]You must be in ovipositor mode for other neomorphs to gain evolution points after round-start![/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-banish = Banish Neomorph
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-readmit = Readmit Neomorph
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dodge = Dodge (200)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dodge-desc = Gain a speed boost for 15 seconds and move through allies and enemies unimpeded. Your speed is doubled near standing enemies.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-burrow = Burrow
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-burrow-desc = Burrow underground preventing you from getting hit from all sources. Once burrowed click a tile to move to it and resurface after a doafter that depends on distance.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-soak = Soak (20)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-soak-desc = Soak in damage for 6 seconds. If you take 140 damage or higher, you regen 75 health and your tail slam gets refreshed.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-crusher-soak = Soak (20)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-crusher-soak-desc = Brace yourself for incoming damage. If you absorb 240 damage within 6 seconds, heal 120 health and reset your tail stab cooldown. [color=red]If the threshold is not reached, the effect expires with no reward.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-empower = Empower (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-empower-desc = On first activation, gain a small amount of shield. After 6 seconds or using it again, get empowered based on surrounding enemies (max 6), gaining shield from each. If you empowered from at least 3 targets, you become Super-Empowered, gaining additional damage on melee attacks, and changing how some of your other abilities work.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-generate-eggs = Generate Eggs (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-generate-eggs-desc = Generate an egg every 30 seconds, which goes into your storage. [color=cyan]Consumes 15 plasma every 2 seconds.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-self-immolate = Self-Immolate (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-self-immolate-desc = Ignite yourself and build heat for Heatshield abilities.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-thermoregulation = Thermoregulation (40)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-thermoregulation-desc = Convert active flames into a short burst of speed, then extinguish yourself.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-store-acid = Store Acid (150)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-store-acid-desc = Store an acid charge, lowering your armor until the charge is spent to hasten an offensive acid ability.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-encased-plates = Encased Plates
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-encased-plates-desc = Toggle a slower defensive stance with stronger frontal plates.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-reflective-shield = Reflective Shield
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-reflective-shield-desc = Brace your plates to reflect incoming bullets for a short time.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-select-chemical = Select Chemical
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-select-chemical-desc = Select the chemical produced by your alchemist glands.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-produce-chemical = Produce Chemical (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-produce-chemical-desc = Convert plasma into the selected alchemical stockpile.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-remove-chemical = Purge Chemical
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-remove-chemical-desc = Purge the selected alchemical stockpile.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-carrion-mantle = Carrion Mantle
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-carrion-mantle-desc = Spend flesh resin to mantle yourself or a hivemate in hardened carrion.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-overmind-change-form = Change Form
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-overmind-change-form-desc = Shift between incorporeal eye and manifested physical form.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-transfer-plasma = Transfer Plasma (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-transfer-plasma-desc = Give plasma to a nearby neomorph.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-healer-drone-transfer-plasma = Transfer Plasma (100)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-healer-drone-transfer-plasma-desc = Give plasma to a nearby neomorph.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-transfer-plasma-hivelord = Transfer Plasma (200)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-transfer-plasma-hivelord-desc = Give plasma to a neomorph.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-resin-surge = Resin Surge (75)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-resin-surge-desc = Instantly grows a fruit when used (cooldown will be proportional to growth time), creates temporary walls when used on weeds or use on existing walls to reinforce them with 6000 hp for 15 seconds. Targeting anything else creates a 3x3 patch of weak sticky resin after a small doafter.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-retrieve = Retrieve (180 plasma, 100 fury)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-retrieve-desc = Pulls a neomorph to you if they are still, with a 0.6 second doafter. You can't pull very big neomorphs unless they are downed.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-aid-heal = Aid Neomorph Healing (100 plasma, 100+ health reserves)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-aid-heal-desc = Heals a nearby ally Xeno. Healing another Xeno will also heal you, and half your remaining health reserves will be consumed for extra healing. [color=red]This can't heal ignited neomorphs![/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-aid-rejuvenate = Aid Neomorph Rejuvenate (100 plasma, 100 health reserves)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-aid-rejuvenate-desc = Remove ailments and stuns from a far away ally Xeno.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-leader = Choose/Follow Neomorph Leaders
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-leader-desc = Promotes and demotes neomorph leaders, or watches them. Promoting a xeno to leader will make them emit your pheromones around themselves.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-heal = Heal Neomorph (600)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-heal-desc = Heals neomorph in a 4 tile range around where you click for 30% of their health over 20 seconds.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-transfer-plasma-queen = Give Plasma (400)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-transfer-plasma-queen-desc = Remotely restores 75% of a single neomorph's max plasma.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-apply-salve = Apply Salve (200)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-apply-salve-desc = Apply a salve to use some of your health to heal allied Xenos up to 100 health over 5 seconds. You can stack multiple salves.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-sacrifice = Sacrifice
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-sacrifice-desc = Sacrifice your life to heal a sister. [color=red]YOU WILL ONLY RESPAWN IF YOU MAXED OUT YOUR TRANSFERRED HEALTH BY HEALING SISTERS.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-fountain = Tail Fountain
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-fountain-desc = Extinguishes fire from a nearby ally or foe. Uses up your melee attack.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tantrum = Tantrum (100 plasma, 75 fury)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tantrum-desc = Give an ally and yourself temporary armor for a few seconds, which lasts longer on you. Crushers and Ravagers get a speed boost instead.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fight-or-flight = Fight or Flight (300 plasma, 75 fury)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fight-or-flight-desc = Remove ailments and stuns from all allies around you. The radius is longer if you have 75+ fury after paying the cost.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-queen-eye = Enter Eye Form
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-queen-eye-desc = Look around any area with weeds remotely. You can use infinite range abilities while in this form, and build resin from afar.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spike-shield = Spike Shield (150 shards)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spike-shield-desc = Expend shards to gain a temporary shield that lasts for a short amount of time. Whenever the shield is damaged, spray bone shards around you in a 5x5 AoE centered on yourself. Shield lasts for 2 seconds.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-bulwark-of-the-hive = Bulwark Of The Hive
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-bulwark-of-the-hive-desc = Grants all hivemembers around you a temporary shield that blocks 200 damage for 10 seconds. While their shield is up, hivemembers can only take damage up to 10% of their health at a time.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-doom = Doom (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-doom-desc = Turns off lights around you for 10 seconds, and slows, dazes, and drains hostiles as well.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-vomit-bile = Vomit Bile (40)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-vomit-bile-desc = Extinguishes a nearby hivemate or sprays volatile bile over enemies in the three tiles in front of you.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-flesh-harvest = Flesh Harvest
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-flesh-harvest-desc = Rip apart a permanently dead marine for flesh resin.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-flesh-bloom = Flesh Bloom
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-flesh-bloom-desc = Spend flesh resin to grow a telegraphed bloom that slows and poisons enemies while soothing the hive.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-turn-invisible = Turn Invisible (20)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-turn-invisible-desc = Become partially invisible for 30 seconds, or until you either damage or attempt to devour an enemy. Can be toggled off to become visible again, with a refund of 90% remaining cloak time. Increases your movement speed by 15% until the ability expires.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-defensive-shield = Defensive Shield (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-defensive-shield-desc = Encase yourself in a protective shield that absorbs 100 damage for 7 seconds. Reduces incoming damage by 8 per hit. Reflects enemy projectiles while active. [color=red]Grants brief explosion immunity on activation.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-normal = Corrosive Acid (100)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-normal-desc = Melts down a structure or item over time.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-weak = Weak Corrosive Acid (75)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-weak-desc = Melts down a structure or item over time.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-strong = Strong Corrosive Acid (125)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-strong-desc = Melts down a structure or item over time.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-acider = Strong Corrosive Acid (100 acid)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-acider-desc = Melts down barricades or items over time. You cannot melt structures.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-regurgitate = Regurgitate
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-regurgitate-desc = Eject any devoured marines.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-stab = Tail Stab
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-stab-desc = Launches an attack towards a given direction. The cooldown is faster if you miss.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-slam = Tail Slam
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-stab-corrosive = Corrosive Tail Stab
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-stab-corrosive-desc = Launches an attack towards a given direction. The cooldown is faster if you miss. [color=red]It also injects diluted molecular acid into the target, dealing damage over time.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-stab-boiler = Corrosive Tail Stab
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-stab-boiler-desc = Launches an attack towards a given direction. The cooldown is faster if you miss. [color=red]It also injects diluted molecular acid or neurotoxin into the target, dealing damage or stunning over time. Which type depends on current gas type.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-leap = Leap
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-leap-desc = Jump towards a given location and knock down the first enemy hit.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-rush = Rush
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-rush-desc = Jump towards a given location and slash the enemy you hit, shaking their screen.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-pounce = Pounce (20)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-pounce-desc = Jump towards a given location and knock down the first enemy hit [color=red]if you are invisible.[/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-assault = Assault (25)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-assault-desc = Charge towards a location. Destroys some objects in your path. Melee slashes reduce assault's cooldown. If Super-Empowered, stuns and flings back the first enemy hit.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dash = Dash (40)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dash-desc = Dash a short distance towards a given location.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-headbutt = Headbutt (10)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-headbutt-desc = Charge towards the targeted enemy and push back the first enemy hit, piercing armor slightly. Does less damage but has more knockback when crest is lowered.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-sweep = Tail Sweep (10)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-sweep-desc = Knock down any enemies close to you.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-slowing-spit = Slowing Spit (20)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-slowing-spit-desc = Launches a damageless projectile that will slow the first enemy that it hits, and paralyze them if they have no armor. It'll also drain helpful substances from their body.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-scattered-spit = Scattered Spit (20)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-scattered-spit-desc = Launches multiple damageless projectiles that will briefly paralyze any enemies they hit.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spit = Xeno Spit (25)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spit-desc = Launches a projectile that will deal damage to the first enemy that it hits.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-charge-spit = Charge Spit (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-charge-spit-desc = Charges up your next spit, making it deal more damage and coat the enemy in acid, but have less range. Increases your movement speed until the ability expires.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spray-acid = Spray Acid (40)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spray-acid-desc = Sprays acid along the ground in a line, covering tiles with it. [color=red]Will coat barricades in acid and significantly strengthen acid inflicted from Charge Spit![/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spray-acid-boiler-desc = Sprays acid along the ground in a line, covering tiles with it. [color=red]Will coat barricades in acid![/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spray-acid-praetorian = Spray Acid (80)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spray-acid-praetorian-desc = Sprays acid along the ground in a line, covering tiles with it. [color=red]Will coat barricades in acid![/color]
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spray-acid-warden = Spray Acid (130)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-mine = Acid Mine (40)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-mine-desc = Cause an acid explosion at the targeted location.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-shotgun = Acid Shotgun (40)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-acid-shotgun-desc = Launches multiple acid projectiles that deal increased damage to trapped targets.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-deploy-traps = Deploy Traps (60)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-deploy-traps-desc = Deploys a line of snaring traps.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-lance = Tail Lance
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-lance-desc = Launches a fast tail thrust. The cooldown is shorter if you miss.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-venator-corrosive-spit = Corrosive Spit (45)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-venator-corrosive-spit-desc = Spit concentrated acid that leaves a small corrosive pool.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-venator-acid-blob = Acid Blob (65)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-venator-acid-blob-desc = Lob a heavier glob of acid that knocks down a direct hit and spreads pools around impact.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-venator-enzymatic-breath = Enzymatic Breath (55)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-venator-enzymatic-breath-desc = Spit a short spread of acid that marks an area with corrosive pools.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-plate-bash = Plate Bash
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-plate-bash-desc = Bash a nearby enemy with your crest plates.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-bulwark-tail-swing = Tail Swing
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-bulwark-tail-swing-desc = Sweep nearby enemies with your tail.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-injection = Tail Injection
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-tail-injection-desc = Inject your stored chemical mixture into a nearby target.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-rapture = Rapture
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-rapture-desc = Rip flesh resin from a nearby enemy.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-reaper-red-gas = Red Gas
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-reaper-red-gas-desc = Spend flesh resin to send a widening cloud of toxic gas marching toward a target.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-paralyzing-slash = Blight Slash
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-paralyzing-slash-desc = Prime your next strike to slow the target on hit.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-place-spore-sac = Place Spore Sac
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-place-spore-sac-desc = Plant a sac that will burst into a cloud of toxic spores.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-direct-spore-infect = Direct Infect
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-direct-spore-infect-desc = Press a handful of spores against an adjacent target, directly infecting them.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-blight-wave = Blight Wave
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-blight-wave-desc = Emit a raspy guttural roar that extinguishes lights and overwhelms nearby enemies.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-cyclone = Cyclone
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-cyclone-desc = Channel briefly then spin in a devastating circle. Hit enough targets to trigger additional expanding spin cycles.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-mycotoxin-inject = Mycotoxin Injection
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-mycotoxin-inject-desc = Skewer a dead target with your tail, injecting mycotoxin. They will rise again to serve the Confluence.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-mycotoxin-inject-matriarch = Mycotoxin Injection
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-mycotoxin-inject-matriarch-desc = Skewer a critically wounded or dead target with your tail, injecting mycotoxin. They will rise again to serve the Confluence.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-crush = Crush (25)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-crush-desc = Slam the ground with a 7x7 AOE, slowing down and disarming all enemies in range. Deals heavy damage to targets you are on top of.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-directional-stomp = Stomp (30)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-directional-stomp-desc = Slam the ground in a cone in front of you, dealing heavy damage and knocking back all enemies caught in the blast.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-stomp = Stomp (30)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-stomp-desc = Slam the ground with a 5x5 AOE, slowing down and disarming all enemies in range. Deals heavy damage to targets you are on top of.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-impale = Impale (80)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-impale-desc = Impales an adjacent enemy with your tail. Hits twice on a marked target and removes the mark. Pierces armor.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spike-shed = Spike Shed (all shards)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-spike-shed-desc = Shred all of your shards to launch them all in all directions around yourself. Lose the bonus armor in the process while also gaining a speed boost. This will disable you from gaining any shards for 30 seconds. Requires 50 shards minimum
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-bone-chips = Bone Chips
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-bone-chips-desc = Launch a projectile that will damage and slow down the first enemy it hits.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-headbite = Headbite
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-headbite-desc = Instantly kills unconscious targets and heals you for 150 HP.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dislocate = Dislocate (55)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dislocate-desc = Punch a targeted enemy, doing some damage and pushing them back. If the target is slowed, stunned, downed, or rooted, instead roots and completely pierces armor. Reduces the cooldown of Abduct and Tail Lash.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-abduct = Tentacle Grab
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-abduct-desc = Cast out a line that after a small doafter pulls in enemies towards you, disarming them. Catching 1 target slows them, 2 roots them, and 3 or more stuns them.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-scissor-cut = Savage (25)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-scissor-cut-desc = Cuts enemies and fences in a straight line. If Super-Empowered, slows enemies hit too.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-plant-weeds = Plant Weeds (75)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-plant-weeds-desc = Plant a weed node that will spread more weeds.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-choose-structure = Choose Resin Structure
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-choose-structure-desc = Choose a structure to secrete with the 'Secrete Resin' action.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-secrete-structure = Secrete Resin
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-secrete-structure-desc = Builds the structure chosen with the 'Choose Resin Structure' action.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-coerce-resin = Coerce Resin
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-coerce-resin-desc = Builds the structure chosen with the 'Choose Resin Structure' action. You may also build within line of sight if you are on weeds.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-order-construction = Order Construction
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-order-construction-desc = Starts construction of an important hive structure.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-resin-hole = Plant Resin Hole (200)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-resin-hole-desc = Places a resin hole on weeds. It can be filled with boiler gas, acid, or parasites.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fruit-choose = Change Fruit
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fruit-choose-desc = Choose a fruit to be planted with 'Plant Resin Fruit' action.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fruit-plant = Plant Resin Fruit (100)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fruit-plant-desc = Plant chosen resin fruit on weeds at the cost of health and plasma. Xenos can pick these fruits once they're mature, you can also pick a plant early to get rid of it. Xenos can use them in hand or eat them on the ground to gain their effects. They can also be used on other xenos to feed them. You can only have 6 fruits planted and picked at a time.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-plant-weeds-hardy = Plant Hardy Weeds (125)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-plant-weeds-hardy-desc = Plant a weed node that will spread hardier weeds, which grow fruit 25% faster, have slightly more health, and can be spread on some surfaces where normal weeds won't grow.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fruit-plant-lesser = Plant Resin Fruit (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-fruit-plant-lesser-desc = Plant resin fruit on weeds at the cost of health and plasma.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dig-tunnel = Dig Tunnel (200)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-dig-tunnel-desc = Dig a tunnel for speedy transportation across the hive.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-expand-weeds = Expand Weeds (50)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-expand-weeds-desc = Expand existing weeds or turn a weed tile into a node.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-designer-selected-design = Selected Design
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-designer-selected-design-desc = Toggle whether newly placed design nodes are wall or door nodes.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-designer-greater-resin-surge = Greater Resin Surge (250)
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-designer-greater-resin-surge-desc = Consumes nearby design nodes to create temporary reflective resin walls.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-evolve = Evolve
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-evolve-desc = Evolve to the next caste of neomorph or choose a strain if one is available.
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-devolve = De-evolve
ent-c-m-u14-action-xeno-pathogen-devolve-desc = Devolve to the previous caste of neomorph. [color=red]You won't get your evolution points refunded![/color]
ent-c-m-u-c-l-f-synth-subversion-key = Modified WY synthetic reset key
ent-c-m-u-c-l-f-synth-subversion-key-desc = This device can fix major glitches or programming errors of synthetic units, as well as being able to restart a synthetic that has suffered critical failure. It can only be used once before being reset. This one has been illegally modified. Who knows what it could do.
ent-a-u14-scissors = Barber's Scissors
ent-a-u14-scissors-desc = A pair of scissors used for cutting hair. They have a sharp blade and a comfortable grip, making them ideal for precise cutting. They are commonly used by barbers and hairstylists to create clean and stylish haircuts.
ent-a-u14-maintenance-jack = K92 Maintenance Jack
ent-a-u14-maintenance-jack-desc = A small carryable maintenance jack used to service vehicles, can also act as a bludgeoning device that comes in handy in emergencies. Can be used to disengage door jacks.
ent-a-u14-maintenance-jack-special = K92-S Special Maintenance Jack
ent-a-u14-maintenance-jack-special-desc = A very-heavy combination crowbar, wrench, and generally large bludgeoning device that comes in handy in emergencies. Can be used to disengage door jacks. Incredibly hefty, though.
ent-a-u14-spray-cleaner = cleaner spray
ent-a-u14-spray-cleaner-desc = A spray bottle filled with a cleaning solution. It is used to clean various surfaces and objects.
ent-a-u14-spray-cleaner-big = big cleaner spray
ent-a-u14-spray-cleaner-big-desc = A large spray bottle filled with a cleaning solution. It is used to clean various surfaces and objects.
ent-a-u14-spray-cleaner-experimental = experimental cleaner spray
ent-a-u14-spray-cleaner-experimental-desc = An experimental spray bottle filled with an cleaning solution. It's capable of self-regenerating the cleaning solution by harvesting ambient compounds from the surrounding atmosphere. It is used to clean various surfaces and objects.
ent-a-u14-i-d-card-g-o-v-f-o-r = govfor identification card
ent-a-u14-i-d-card-g-o-v-f-o-r-desc = An ID Card used by GOVFOR personnel for identification and access control. You cannot tell who or what it belongs to.
