ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-sign-tactical-desc = This field manual contains the complete tactical-sign language. It can be used to silently coordinate an ambush, request a medevac, or inform your squadmate that they've been promoted to bait.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-yautja = Treatise of the Hunt's Tongue
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-yautja-desc = This bloodstained codex is filled with the clicks and growls of the Yautja language. The cover warns that reading aloud some parts may attract unwanted attention, or worse, an honorary duel.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-arcturian = arcturian language pamphlet
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-latin = Treatise of the Eternal Republic
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-latin-desc = This appears to be a preserved record of ancient Roman governance, culture, and language.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-portuguese = Treatise of the Lusitanian Voyages
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-portuguese-desc = This appears to be a collection of records concerning explorers, sailors, and distant colonies.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-spanish = Treatise of the Two Spains
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-spanish-desc = This appears to be a chronicle of the kingdoms, poets, and revolutions that shaped the Spanish-speaking worlds.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-arabic = Treatise of the Golden Caliphates
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-arabic-desc = This appears to be a collection of writings concerning the great civilizations of the Arab world.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-french = Treatise of the Courtly Tongues
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-french-desc = This appears to be a record of the refined speech of diplomats, revolutionaries, and philosophers from old France.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-german = Treatise of the Iron Lexicon
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-german-desc = This appears to be a compendium of precise compound words and the unyielding grammar of the German language.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-russian = Treatise of the Frozen Expanse
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-russian-desc = This appears to be a history of the Russian people, their vast lands, and the Cyrillic script that captured their soul.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-japanese = Treatise of the Rising Sun
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-japanese-desc = This appears to be a record of the islands of Japan, their layered politeness, and the brushstrokes of their language.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-mandarin = Treatise of the Celestial Court
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-mandarin-desc = This appears to be a chronicle of the Middle Kingdom, its tonal tongue, and the thousands of characters that carry its history.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-turkish = Treatise of the Anatolian Realms
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-turkish-desc = This appears to be a record of the peoples and empires that once flourished across Anatolia.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-korean = Treatise of the Morning Calm
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-korean-desc = This appears to be a chronicle of the Korean peninsula and its long history.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-swahili = Treatise of the Swahili Coast
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-swahili-desc = This appears to be a history of the coastal cities and trade networks of East Africa.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-afrikaans = Treatise of the Cape Frontiers
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-afrikaans-desc = This appears to be a historical account of the settlements and cultures of southern Africa.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-binary = Treatise of the Zero-One Codex
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-binary-desc = This appears to be a data slug containing the foundational logic of machine speech, pure information stripped of emotion.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-legalese = Treatise of the Binding Clause
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-legalese-desc = This appears to be a standard form contract, composed entirely of sub‑clauses, waivers, and definitions, from which the language of corporate power is learned.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-ukrainian = Treatise of the Ukrainian Steppes
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-ukrainian-desc = This appears to be a collection of stories, history, and traditions from the vast Ukrainian steppes.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-polish = Treatise of the Polish Commonwealth
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-polish-desc = This appears to be a detailed account of the old Polish Commonwealth and its cultural legacy.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-czech = Treatise of the Bohemian Crownlands
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-czech-desc = This appears to be a historical record of the Bohemian lands and their people.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-italian = Treatise of the Italian Peninsula
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-italian-desc = This appears to be a historical account of the city-states and nations of Italy.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-irish = Treatise of the Emerald Isle
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-irish-desc = This appears to be a collection of Irish folklore, history, and traditions.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-finnish = Treatise of the Northern Lakes
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-finnish-desc = This appears to be a record of Finland's wilderness and resilient people.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-hungarian = Treatise of the Carpathian Basin
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-hungarian-desc = This appears to be a history of the kingdoms and peoples of the Carpathian Basin.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-albanian = Treatise of the Eagle's Mountains
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-albanian-desc = This appears to be a record of the rugged lands and traditions of Albania.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-serbian = Treatise of the Balkan Heartlands
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-serbian-desc = This appears to be a chronicle of the peoples and kingdoms of the central Balkans.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-lithuanian = Treatise of the Baltic Duchies
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-lithuanian-desc = This appears to be a record of the Baltic peoples and their ancient heritage.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-dutch = Treatise of the Low Countries
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-dutch-desc = This appears to be a record of the merchant republics and kingdoms of the Low Countries.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-persian = Treatise of the Persian Plateau
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-persian-desc = This appears to be a chronicle of empires, scholars, and poets from Persia.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-hindi = Treatise of the Ganges Plains
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-hindi-desc = This appears to be a record of the cultures and peoples of northern India.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-vietnamese = Treatise of the Red River Delta
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-vietnamese-desc = This appears to be a historical account of Vietnam and its enduring traditions.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-indonesian = Treatise of the Emerald Archipelago
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-indonesian-desc = This appears to be a record of the many islands and peoples of Indonesia.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-filipino = Treatise of the Pearl Islands
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-filipino-desc = This appears to be a history of the islands, cultures, and peoples of the Philippines.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-urdu = Treatise of the Mughal Courts
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-urdu-desc = This appears to be a collection of literature and records from the courts of South Asia.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-yoruba = Treatise of the Forest Kingdoms
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-yoruba-desc = This appears to be a chronicle of the kingdoms and traditions of the Yoruba people.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-esperanto = Treatise of the Hopeful Language
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-esperanto-desc = This appears to be a manifesto for a constructed tongue that seeks to unite all peoples under a single, regular grammar.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-swedish = Treatise of the Swedish Frontiers
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-swedish-desc = This appears to be a record of the Scandinavian frontiers, a shadowy region that is the subject of much controversy from the conflict between the Socialist Progressive Peoples and its separatists.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-brazilian = Treatise of the Verdant Empire
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-brazilian-desc = This appears to be a chronicle of the vast forests, diverse peoples, and vibrant dialects of Brazil.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-slovak = Treatise of the Tatra Mountains
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-slovak-desc = This appears to be a record of the proud nation between the peaks, its language a bridge between Slavic brothers.
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-romanian = Treatise of the Carpathian Crossroads
ent-a-u14-pamphlet-language-romanian-desc = This appears to be a history of the Romanians, whose Latin roots survived amidst centuries of change.
