ent-a-u-metal-ingot = metal ingot
ent-a-u-metal-ingot-desc = A crude ingot of smelted metal. Ready for further processing.
ent-a-u-weyland-yutani-doorknob = Weyland-Yutani doorknob
ent-a-u-weyland-yutani-doorknob-desc = A precision-machined doorknob stamped with the Weyland-Yutani logo.
ent-a-u14-tall-floodlight = tall floodlight
ent-a-u14-tall-floodlight-desc = A pillar of light in the darkness.
ent-a-u14-floodlight-broken = tall broken floodlight
ent-a-u14-floodlight-broken-desc = A pasted on note says 'To fix, unscrew the panel, crowbar out the damaged assembly, weld it fixed, add 2 cable, then close the panel.'
ent-a-u14-streetlight = colony streetlight
ent-a-u14-streetlight-broken = broken colony streetlight
ent-a-u14-streetlight-broken-desc = A pasted on note says 'To fix, unscrew the panel, crowbar out the damaged assembly, weld it fixed, add 2 cable, then close the panel.'
ent-a-u14-radio-jammer = radio jammer
ent-a-u14-radio-jammer-desc = This device will disrupt nearby outgoing radio communication, including friendly communications.
ent-a-u14-grenade-neuro-gas = CN20 Nerve Gas
ent-a-u14-remote-signaller-advanced = ProtonCall XL Portable Telephone
ent-a-u14-remote-signaller-advanced-desc = A Weyland-Yutani brickphone made by a subsidiary of their communications division. Probably pried from the dead hands of some corporate shmuck. This one’s being used for dialing CLF IEDs. Someone etched 'Fuck the United Americas' into the side.
ent-a-u14-i-e-d = improvised explosive device
ent-a-u14-i-e-d-desc = A remote explosive designed to cripple foot soldiers and lightly armored vehicles. A saboteur’s and insurgent’s favorite tool of terror. Be careful... its very unstable.
ent-a-u14-i-e-d-large = huge improvised explosive device
ent-a-u14-i-e-d-large-desc = A rather large remote explosive designed to cripple foot soldiers and lightly armored vehicles. A saboteur’s and insurgent’s favorite tool of terror. Be careful... its very unstable.
ent-a-u14-i-e-d-vest = improvised explosive vest
ent-a-u14-i-e-d-vest-desc = A worn suicide explosive vest designed to cripple foot soldiers. Those who use it will never return...
ent-a-u14-i-e-d-guide = improvised explosives guide
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-s-e-a-u-s-c-m = senior advisor chevrons briefcase
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-s-e-a-u-s-c-m-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense small items.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-r-m-c-ranks = royal marines rank chevrons briefcase
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-r-m-c-ranks-desc = A compact RMC-issued rank storage case. Holds standardized chevrons for field replacement and ceremonial use.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-u-p-p-n-i-ranks = upp naval infantry rank chevrons briefcase
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-u-p-p-n-i-ranks-desc = A compact UPP-issue rank case. Heavy, red-stamped, and politically overcorrect in every way imaginable.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-we-yu-ranks = weyu pmc rank chevrons briefcase
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-we-yu-ranks-desc = A corporate-issued rank storage unit. Everything is color-coded, optimized, and slightly threatening.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-pr-d-ranks = prd response unit rank chevrons briefcase
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-pr-d-ranks-desc = A cheaply manufactured contractor briefcase filled with laminated rank chevrons and corporate optimism.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-s-e-a-l-a-c-n = senior advisor chevrons briefcase
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-s-e-a-l-a-c-n-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense naval rank insignia.
ent-c-m-u-cipher-hint-paper = Research Ciphering Breakthrough
ent-c-m-u-cipher-hint-paper-no-spawn = Research Ciphering Breakthrough
ent-c-m-u-cipher-hint-paper-inform-deliv = Research Ciphering Breakthrough
ent-a-u14-cigarette-pack-balajj = balaji imperial packet
ent-a-u14-cigarette-pack-balajj-desc = A pack of Balaji Imperials. Hand-rolled, filter-tipped cigarettes produced in the Three World Empire by the Balaji family of companies. Still family-run after six generations, the company’s known for mixing high-grade synthetic tobacco with trace amounts of real leaf. Expensive, smooth, and a favorite among officers and smugglers alike.
ent-a-u14-cigarette-koorlander = koorlander packet
ent-a-u14-cigarette-koorlander-desc = First handed out in bulk to terraforming crews as a no-frills necessity, these cigarettes lit easily, burned evenly, and offered a straightforward, dependable smoke. The flat, dusty flavor and steady draw quickly made them a colonial staple. Koorlander later scaled production on frontier farming worlds and locked in exclusive trade deals with the Colonial Administration.
ent-a-u14-cigarette-lady-fingers = koorlander lady fingers packet
ent-a-u14-cigarette-lady-fingers-desc = A bold experiment in marketing by the Koolander Corporation, these brutal, unfiltered menthol cigarettes come in dusty rose packaging aimed at the women of the Colonies. The scent is so overpowering that they are sometimes used to keep bugs out of field tents. Despite the effort, they are rarely chosen and mostly sit untouched in vending machines, quietly daring someone to try. Whether anyone actually likes them is another question.
ent-a-u14-m-r-e-t-w-e-r-m-c = RMC ration pack
ent-a-u14-m-r-e-t-w-e-r-m-c-desc = An Operation Ration Pack. Uses similar to USCM MRE format, but utilizes expensive preserving materials and methods and not less expensive meals from TWE cuisine.
ent-a-u14-m-r-e-u-p-p = UPP ration pack
ent-a-u14-m-r-e-u-p-p-desc = An Individual Meal Ration, mainly composed of a selection of canned food, despite being heavier, it has proven to be a lot more reliable.
ent-a-u14-box-m-r-e-u-p-p-empty = box of UPP MREs (x12)
ent-a-u14-box-m-r-e-u-p-p = box of UPP MREs (x12)
ent-a-u14-box-m-r-e-t-w-e-r-m-c-empty = box of RMC MREs (x12)
ent-a-u14-box-m-r-e-t-w-e-r-m-c = box of RMC MREs (x12)
ent-a-u14-objective-item-portable-radio-transceiver = AN/PRC-982 portable radio transceiver box
ent-a-u14-objective-item-portable-radio-transceiver-desc = A gray radio box that is used to receive long-range communications. It also records all radio traffic it receives.
ent-a-u14-objective-item-blackbox-recorder = CIR-60 'blackbox' colony information recorder
ent-a-u14-objective-item-blackbox-recorder-desc = A small red box that records colony announcements, colonist flatlines and other key readouts. Usually refered to the black box, although this one comes in bloody red.
ent-a-u14-objective-item-atmospheric-radar-storage-unit = ARCS-9 atmospheric radar data storage unit
ent-a-u14-objective-item-atmospheric-radar-storage-unit-desc = A black data box that is used to store information from atmospheric radar arrays.
ent-a-u14-objective-item-w-y-laptop = Weyland-Yutani Research Laptop
ent-a-u14-objective-item-w-y-laptop-desc = A portable computer containing research data from Weyland-Yutani. Password protected and encrypted, this will take a lot to crack.
ent-a-u14-objective-item-theater-handbook = Theater Operations Handbook
ent-a-u14-objective-item-theater-handbook-desc = A highly classified book containing the battle plans of a major faction within the current theater of war.
ent-a-u14-objective-item-nuclear-launch-codes = Nuclear Launch Codes Booklet
ent-a-u14-objective-item-nuclear-launch-codes-desc = A highly classified book containing nuclear launch codes.
ent-a-u14-objective-item-a-i-processor = AI Processor
ent-a-u14-objective-item-a-i-processor-desc = An external processor for an AI, used to process vast amounts of information.
ent-a-u14-objective-item-hackable-computer = field operations computer
ent-a-u14-objective-item-hackable-computer-desc = A ruggedized military laptop containing encrypted communications data. It can be hacked to extract critical intelligence.
ent-c-m-u14-portable-vendor-prodigy-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense small items. This one has the Prodigy logo stamped on its side.
ent-c-m-u-drone-control-tablet = drone control tablet
ent-c-m-u-drone-control-tablet-desc = A ruggedized command tablet used to link and remotely pilot one drone android within a short tactical leash.
ent-c-m-u-drone-operator-pack-filled = drone operator field pack
ent-c-m-u-drone-operator-pack-filled-desc = A compact field pack issued with a drone controller, disassembled drone android frame, tools, and swappable drone modules.
ent-c-m-u-drone-body-frame = drone android body frame
ent-c-m-u-drone-body-frame-desc = A bare synthetic torso frame with sealed limb ports and an empty activation socket.
ent-c-m-u-drone-part-base = drone android part
ent-c-m-u-drone-part-base-desc = A stripped synthetic assembly part for a drone android.
ent-c-m-u-drone-head-assembly = drone android head
ent-c-m-u-drone-head-assembly-desc = A bare synthetic head assembly with minimal sensor and control hardware.
ent-c-m-u-drone-left-arm-assembly = drone android left arm
ent-c-m-u-drone-left-arm-assembly-desc = A left arm assembly with exposed actuator bundles.
ent-c-m-u-drone-right-arm-assembly = drone android right arm
ent-c-m-u-drone-right-arm-assembly-desc = A right arm assembly with exposed actuator bundles.
ent-c-m-u-drone-left-leg-assembly = drone android left leg
ent-c-m-u-drone-left-leg-assembly-desc = A left leg assembly with reinforced knee servos.
ent-c-m-u-drone-right-leg-assembly = drone android right leg
ent-c-m-u-drone-right-leg-assembly-desc = A right leg assembly with reinforced knee servos.
ent-c-m-u-drone-synth-key = drone synth key
ent-c-m-u-drone-synth-key-desc = A locked synthetic authorization key used to bring a completed drone android frame online.
ent-c-m-u-drone-module-base = drone module
ent-c-m-u-drone-module-base-desc = A swappable control module designed for a drone android's internal tool bus.
ent-c-m-u-drone-module-combat = drone combat module
ent-c-m-u-drone-module-combat-desc = A tactical combat module loaded with close-quarters and firearms routines.
ent-c-m-u-drone-module-care = drone care module
ent-c-m-u-drone-module-care-desc = A medical care module loaded with doctor-grade treatment and surgery routines.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-u-a-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense small items. This one has the star and stripes of the United Americas embossed on its side.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-t-w-e-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense small items. This one has the emblem of the Three World Empire embossed on its side.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-u-p-p-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense small items. This one has the stars of the UPP embossed on its side.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-i-c-s-c-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense small items. This one has the logo of the ICSC embossed on its side.
ent-a-u14-portable-vendor-c-c-a-desc = A suitcase-sized automated storage and retrieval system. Designed to efficiently store and selectively dispense small items. This one has the rising banner of the CCA embossed on its side.
ent-a-u14-tablet-opfor = opfor command tablet
ent-a-u14-tablet-opfor-desc = A portable command interface for Opfor command, linked to their faction's systems.
ent-a-u14-tablet-govfor = govfor command tablet
ent-a-u14-tablet-govfor-desc = A portable command interface for Govfor command, linked to their faction's systems.
ent-c-m-u-paper-slip-base = paper slip
ent-c-m-u-paper-slip-base-desc = A plain slip of paper.
ent-c-m-u-paper-slip-medication = medication slip
ent-c-m-u-paper-slip-medication-desc = A standardized prescription slip produced by the International Committee of the Red Cross. Used by Medical personnel to authorize, track, and strictly ration the distribution of controlled pharmaceuticals.
ent-c-m-u-paper-slip-medication-green = medication slip
ent-c-m-u-paper-slip-medication-green-desc = A standardized prescription slip produced by the International Committee of the Red Cross. Used by Medical personnel to authorize, track, and strictly ration the distribution of controlled pharmaceuticals.
ent-c-m-u-paper-photo-potato = cat photograph
ent-c-m-u-paper-photo-potato-desc = A photograph of an evil looking cat... It's staring at you.
ent-c-m-u-paper-i-c-s-c = ICSC paper
ent-c-m-u-paper-i-c-s-c-desc = A paper with Independent Core System Colonies letterhead.
ent-c-m-u-paper-u-s-c-m = USCM paper
ent-c-m-u-paper-u-s-c-m-desc = A sheet of paper bearing the United States Colonial Marine Corps letterhead.
ent-c-m-u-paper-flag-u-a = UA paper
