ent-a-u14-naloxone-auto-injector = naloxone autoinjector
ent-a-u14-naloxone-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with naloxone, used to instantly counteract toxin damage. Primarily used to treat overdoses. Doesn't require any training to use.
ent-c-m-u-epinephrine-auto-injector = epinephrine autoinjector
ent-c-m-u-epinephrine-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with epinephrine, sometimes referred to as an 'EpiPen'. It is used to treat severe allergic reactions, though it can also be used to help restart someone's heart. Doesn't require any training to use.
ent-c-m-u-asthma-inhaler-desc = A small, sealed inhaler pre-loaded with a single dose of albuterol. It cannot be refilled or have its medication removed.
ent-a-u14-first-aid-auto-injector-no-skill = first-aid autoinjector
ent-a-u14-first-aid-auto-injector-no-skill-desc = An autoinjector loaded with a dose of tricordrazine and a small ammount of dexalin for wounded soldiers to treat themselves with.
ent-a-u14-mera-bic-auto-injector = mera-bic autoinjector
ent-a-u14-mera-bic-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of both Meralyne and Bicaridine.
ent-a-u14-kelo-derm-auto-injector = kelo-derm autoinjector
ent-a-u14-kelo-derm-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of both Meralyne and Bicaridine.
ent-a-u14-revival-mix-auto-injector = revival mix autoinjector
ent-a-u14-revival-mix-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of Epinephrine, Inaprovaline and Tricordrazine.
ent-a-u14-albu-dex-auto-injector = albu-dex autoinjector
ent-a-u14-albu-dex-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of Albuterol and Dexalin as well as a small dose of Dexalin+.
ent-a-u14-oxycodone-auto-injector = oxycodone autoinjector
ent-a-u14-oxycodone-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of Oxycodone.
ent-a-u14-tramadol-auto-injector = tramadol autoinjector
ent-a-u14-tramadol-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of Tramadol.
ent-a-u14-paracetamol-auto-injector = paracetamol autoinjector
ent-a-u14-paracetamol-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of Paracetamol.
ent-c-m-u-fentanyl-auto-injector = fentanyl autoinjector
ent-c-m-u-fentanyl-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of Fentanyl.
ent-c-m-u-methamphetamine-auto-injector = methamphetamine autoinjector
ent-c-m-u-methamphetamine-auto-injector-desc = An autoinjector loaded with 3 uses of Methamphetamine.
ent-a-u14-hemostatic-gauze-packet = hemostatic gauze packet
ent-a-u14-hemostatic-gauze-packet-desc = A vacuum sealed packet of chemically treated gauze designed to stop arterial bleeding fast. The powder burns like hell, but it works. Single-use. Rip it open, jam it in, hope for the best.
ent-a-u14-hemostatic-gauze-packet-trash = used hemostatic gauze packet
ent-a-u14-hemostatic-gauze-packet-trash-desc = A vacuum sealed packet of chemically treated gauze designed to stop arterial bleeding fast. The powder burns like hell, but it works. Single-use. This one is trash, its already been used!
ent-a-u14-hemostatic-gauze = hemostatic gauze
ent-a-u14-hemostatic-gauze-desc = A strip of gauze soaked with a powdery clotting agent. Once it’s out of the packet, the clock’s ticking, stuff it deep into the wound and stop the bleeding before it’s too late.
ent-a-u14-tourniquet = CAT tourniquet
ent-a-u14-tourniquet-desc = A single use tourniquet designed for self-application under fire. The CAT uses a high-tension Velcro strap and windlass rod to cut off arterial bleeding on limbs. Effective, painful and not exactly gentle. Overuse can lead to nerve damage or amputation. Still, better maimed than dead.
ent-c-m-encryption-key-p-a-r-t = PART encryption key
ent-c-m-u-pathogen-spore-sac-item = spore sac
ent-c-m-u-pathogen-spore-sac-item-desc = A fleshy sac, ready to be planted.
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-rocket-thermobaric-two = BLU-176 'Overpressure'
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-rocket-thermobaric-two-desc = The BLU-176 'Overpressure' is a thermobaric fuel-air bomb and the smaller cousin of the BLU-200 'Dragon’s Breath'.  The aerosolized fuel mixture creates a vacuum when ignited, causing severe damage to anything in its path. It can be loaded into the LAU-444 Guided Missile Launcher.
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-mk102-j-d-a-m = GBU-89B 'Postman'
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-mk102-j-d-a-m-desc = The GBU-89B Joint Direct Attack Munition is an old but reliable large guided munition. It has an excessively long travel time, but can level entire buildings. It can be loaded into the LAU-444 Guided Missile Launcher.
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-g-b-u89-i = GBU-89C/N 'Burning Postman'
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-g-b-u89-i-desc = The GBU-89B/Napalm Joint Direct Attack Munition is an old but reliable large guided munition. It has an excessively long travel time, but can level and set alight entire buildings. It can be loaded into the LAU-444 Guided Missile Launcher.
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-c-b-u250 = CBU-250 'Dinner Spread'
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-c-b-u250-desc = The CBU-250 'Dinner Spread' is a cluster munition designed for use against lightly armored vehicles and enemy infantry. Upon deployment, the munition separates into twelve low-yield bomblets, dispersing them unevenly across a wide area. It can be loaded into the LAU-444 Guided Missile Launcher.
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-rocket-widowmaker-double = AIM-224A 'Double Widow' Rack
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-rocket-widowmaker-double-desc = A two round launch rack of the AIM-224A missile. Earning the nickname of 'Double Widow' due to it being two Widow Makers stacked on top of each other. Both rockets are fired at the same time and are highly unpredictable. Not well suited for ground bombardment but its high velocity makes it reach its target quickly. This one has been modified to be a two round free-fall bomb as a result of dropship ammo shortages. Can be loaded into the LAU-444 Guided Missile Launcher.
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-c-b-u607 = CBU-607 'Skeet Shooter' Rack
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-c-b-u607-desc = The CBU-607 'Skeet Shooter' is a four missile cluster munition rack designed for use against medium armored vehicles and enemy infantry. Upon deployment, each munition separates into two mid-yield bomblets, dispersing them tightly across a small area. It can be loaded into the LAU-444 Guided Missile Launcher.
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-rocket-banshee-horde = AIM-207 'Cutlass' rack
ent-a-u14-dropship-attachment-ammo-rocket-banshee-horde-desc = A four-round launch rack of AIM-207 "Cutlass" missiles modified for ground strikes. Originally an air-to-air missile, the Cutlass was adapted with a simplified guidance package and a proximity-fused warhead, allowing the rack to disperse all four rockets in a wide saturation pattern over a designated target area. It can be loaded into the LAU-444 Guided Missile Launcher.
ent-a-u14-flag-carriable-u-a = UA flag
ent-a-u14-flag-carriable-u-a-desc = The flag of the United Americas. You can smell oil." # This one looks ready to be planted into the ground.
ent-a-u14-flag-carriable-u-p-p = UPP flag
ent-a-u14-flag-carriable-u-p-p-desc = The flag of the Union of Progressive People. You can smell anti-consumerism." # This one looks ready to be planted into the ground.
ent-a-u14-geiger-counter-u-p-p-desc = A hand-held tool used to detect radiation, measured in Sieverts. A Staple of CBRN crew and nuclear engineers, this model appears to be made by Hyperdyne Corporation.
ent-a-u14-flag-carriable-c-l-f = CLF flag
ent-a-u14-flag-carriable-c-l-f-desc = The flag of the Colonial Liberation Front. You can smell freedom." # This one looks ready to be planted into the ground.
ent-a-u14-flare-r-m-c-desc = An RMC issued flare that burns in both the visual and ultraviolet spectrum. There are instructions on the side, it reads 'pull cord, make light'.
ent-a-u14-pack-flare-base-r-m-c-desc = A packet of eight M94 Marking Flares. Carried by Marine soldiers to light dark areas that cannot be reached with the usual TNR Shoulder Lamp.
ent-a-u14-box-pack-flare-r-m-c-empty-desc = A box of L96 marking flare packs, to brighten up your day.


